MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Show 8 feels like a useful next step alongside my Fire TV devices because its screen gives me a reason to add an Alexa device.",
    "The Blink bundle fits my existing Blink camera purchase and my interest in home security; covering the front door and more areas would be a practical expansion if compatible."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The earbuds and portable speaker do not serve my current home viewing or security needs, and I have no clear need for the USB hub.",
    "The Echo Dot and Show 5 fit my Alexa interest, but I would choose the Show 8 over buying several overlapping devices. The WYZE camera interests me less than expanding my existing Blink setup."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Buying electronics seems to have been taken as interest in unrelated electronic accessories, even when they solve no current problem for me.",
    "My interest in cameras and Alexa devices seems to have been treated as a reason to add more similar devices without considering what they would add to my setup."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Compatibility with what I already own matters: I would check the Blink bundle and my Canon camcorder's memory card requirements before choosing them.",
    "I choose items for a specific use rather than simply because they fit my interests; I have no confirmed need for two memory cards or multiple Alexa displays."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations understood my interest in connected home viewing and security, but sometimes confused related electronics with useful additions to my existing setup."
}
